# Mazak VQC 20/40 — Post-GUI HAL
# Loaded by mazak_vqc_20_40.ini (POSTGUI_HALFILE) AFTER the GUI starts.
# Connect halui.* / pyvcp.* / gladevcp.* pins here — they do not exist until the GUI
# is up, so they cannot go in the main HAL files.
#
# (stub — add GUI signal connections here once the panel/pendant is defined)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# QtDragon HD (added with the [DISPLAY] rewrite, INI v1.2) — NOTHING ACTIVE YET.
# Comments only. Read before copying anything out of the stock sample at
# /usr/share/doc/linuxcnc/examples/sample-configs/sim/qtdragon_hd/.
#
# The GUI's HAL component is named `qtdragon`, NOT `qtdragon_hd` — the HD screen
# resets its own basename via screenOptions at startup. Pins are `qtdragon.*`.
#
# !! DO NOT COPY THE SAMPLE POSTGUI WHOLESALE — IT WILL BREAK THE ATC !!
# qtdragon_hd_postgui.hal in the sample config contains:
#     unlinkp iocontrol.0.tool-change
#     unlinkp iocontrol.0.tool-changed
#     unlinkp iocontrol.0.tool-prep-number
#     net tool-change  hal_manualtoolchange.change  <= iocontrol.0.tool-change
# That tears this machine's toolchanger out of the loop and substitutes the
# manual "insert tool and click OK" dialog. This machine has a real ATC driven by
# the M6 remap ([RS274NGC] REMAP) and atc_orient.hal. Those three unlinkp lines
# would silently disconnect it.
#
# Optional QtDragon features that need postgui nets, none of them required:
#   - Z level compensation  (loadusr z_level_compensation) — surface mapping,
#     irrelevant to this machine; skip.
#   - spindle pause         net spindle-pause qtdragon.spindle-inhibit \
#                               spindle.0.inhibit
#   - external offsets      qtdragon.eoffset-* against axis.z.eoffset-*, which
#     also needs [AXIS_Z] OFFSET_AV_RATIO set. Not enabled.
#
# UNVERIFIED — none of this has been loaded on the machine. Add real nets only
# after the screen variant is chosen and with a human at the machine.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
